OL,3,GNEWSADairy farmer calls for help to
OL,4,Aface climate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dairy farmer from Shropshire has
OL,7,Fcalled on more support to help make his
OL,8,Findustry more resilient to climate
OL,9,Fchange.
OL,11,FTim Downes is the third generation on
OL,12,Fhis farm in Longnor and said this
OL,13,Fsummer's hot, dry weather has meant
OL,14,Fdairy farmers have had to use lots of
OL,15,Ftheir winter feed.
OL,17,FThe industry may have to put up the
OL,18,Fprice of milk to help tackle the
OL,19,Fproblem, he said.
