OL,3,GNEWSADairy farmer calls for help to
OL,4,Aface climate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment Food and
OL,7,FRural Affairs (Defra) said it
OL,8,Funderstands the challenges they face
OL,9,Fand have put in extra support for
OL,10,Ffarmers. It added a "new #65 million
OL,11,Fdrought package includes an extra #50
OL,12,Fmillion for Sustainable Farming
OL,13,FIncentive agreements for short- and
OL,14,Flong-term resilience."
